`go-api new` doesn't wire up gRPC, mTLS, Tilt/k8s manifests, or a worked
custom-metrics example — see `docs/scaffolding.md`'s "What `new` doesn't
do yet" in github.com/herlenashavi/go-api for the current state and why.
